[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0623","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0623.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1914","title":"Google Chrome V8 越界读取漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 引擎存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），位于 DoubleToRadixString 函数中。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发 V8 引擎的越界内存读取，导致敏感信息泄露或内存破坏，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 134.0.6998.35 之前版本及基于 Chromium 的 Microsoft Edge 134.0.3124.51 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。用户需升级浏览器至修复版本以防范风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1914"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-05T04:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:40:19Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 134.0.6998.35 及以上版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单 > 帮助 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新。使用 Microsoft Edge 的用户应升级至 134.0.3124.51 及以上版本。其他基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Brave、Opera、Vivaldi）请更新至对应厂商发布的最新稳定版。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施（Chrome 设置 > 隐私和安全 > 网站设置 > JavaScript > 禁止），但会影响正常网页功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/03/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/397731718","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1914.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-19xx/CVE-2025-1914.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1914.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0623.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0409","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0686","title":"GNU GRUB2 romfs 文件系统符号链接处理整数溢出漏洞","description":"Grub2 的 romfs 文件系统模块在处理符号链接查找时存在整数溢出漏洞。该模块使用用户可控的文件系统几何参数来确定内部缓冲区大小，但未正确检查整数溢出，导致 grub_malloc() 分配的内存小于预期。当调用 grub_disk_read() 读取符号链接数据时，触发堆越界写入，可破坏 GRUB 内部关键数据结构。攻击者需具备本地高权限并构造恶意的 romfs 文件系统，成功利用后可绕过 Secure Boot 保护机制实现任意代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0686"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB 至 2.14 或更高版本（上游已合入 romfs 符号链接整数溢出修复）；如无法升级，应用厂商安全补丁（Red Hat 已通过 RHSA 修复，执行 yum update grub2）；启用 Secure Boot 并确保 grub2 签名验证生效，禁用不受信任的自定义文件系统镜像加载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0686","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346121","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0686.md","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0686.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0686.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/aac3a899cc6ce8d928dfc5818dafc093b7936010/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0686.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0686","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0686.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0686.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-0686.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0408","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0685","title":"GNU GRUB2 JFS文件系统整数溢出漏洞","description":"Grub2 的 JFS 文件系统模块在处理符号链接时存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过挂载特制的恶意 JFS 文件系统，利用文件系统几何参数中用户可控的字段触发缓冲区大小计算溢出，导致 grub_malloc() 分配的内存小于预期。随后 grub_jfs_lookup_symlink() 函数在调用 grub_jfs_read_file() 读取数据时发生堆越界写入，破坏 GRUB 内部关键数据结构，最终可实现任意代码执行并绕过 Secure Boot 保护机制。该漏洞需攻击者具有本地高权限并能够挂载恶意文件系统，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0685"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"立即将 grub2 升级至包含 2025 年 2 月安全补丁集的版本（grub2 > 2.12，或各发行版对应修复版本，如 Red Hat 的 grub2-2.02-0.87.el8_9 等），同时使用 `mokutil --sbat` 更新 shim 的 SBAT 吊销数据以彻底阻断 Secure Boot 绕过。临时缓解措施：限制物理接触系统的权限，避免攻击者挂载恶意 JFS 文件系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0685","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346120","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0685.md","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0685.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0685.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/aac3a899cc6ce8d928dfc5818dafc093b7936010/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0685.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0685","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0685.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0685.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-0685.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0407","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0684","title":"GNU GRUB reiserfs 模块整数溢出漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 reiserfs 文件系统模块在处理符号链接时存在整数溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过挂载特制的 reiserfs 文件系统，利用文件系统几何参数中用户可控的数值触发缓冲区大小计算溢出，导致 grub_malloc() 分配过小的内存缓冲区，进而在 grub_reiserfs_read_symlink() 调用 grub_reiserfs_read_real() 时使用溢出的长度参数，造成堆越界写入。该漏洞可被利用来破坏 GRUB 内部关键数据，实现任意代码执行，从而绕过 Secure Boot 保护机制。攻击者需要本地高权限访问并具备较高的攻击复杂度。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0684"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 GRUB2 至修复版本：Debian 用户升级至 2.06-3~deb11u7（bullseye）或 2.06-13+deb12u2（bookworm）；Ubuntu 用户安装对应安全更新；RHEL/CentOS 用户安装最新 grub2 安全更新。升级后执行 `grub2-install` 重新安装引导程序并重启。如无法立即升级，可在 grub.cfg 中禁用 reiserfs 模块（`insmod reiserfs` 前加 `#` 注释），并避免使用 reiserfs 作为 /boot 分区。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0684","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346119","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0684.md","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0684.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0684.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/aac3a899cc6ce8d928dfc5818dafc093b7936010/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0684.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0684","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0684.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0684.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-0684.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0406","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0678","title":"GNU GRUB2 squash4文件系统整数溢出导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 squash4 文件系统模块存在整数溢出漏洞。在处理 squash4 文件系统时，grub 的 squash4 模块使用文件系统几何结构中用户可控的参数来确定内部缓冲区大小，但未正确检查整数溢出。攻击者可构造恶意的 squash4 文件系统，使缓冲区大小计算发生整数溢出，导致 grub_malloc() 分配的内存小于预期，进而在 direct_read() 函数执行数据读取时发生堆越界写入。该漏洞可被利用来破坏 GRUB 内部关键数据，最终导致任意代码执行，从而绕过 Secure Boot 保护机制。攻击者需要本地访问权限且能够挂载特制的 squash4 文件系统才能触发该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0678"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T17:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"立即升级 GRUB2 至 2.12 以上版本（含上游安全补丁 84bc0a9a），或应用各发行版提供的 CVE-2025-0678 补丁（将 squash4.c 中 grub_malloc 替换为 grub_calloc 以防止整数溢出）。对于 RHEL 7/8/9/10 用户，安装 Red Hat 发布的对应 grub2 安全更新。同时更新 shim 引导加载器以应用最新的 SBAT 吊销数据，通过 `mokutil --sb-state` 确认 Secure Boot 状态，并使用 `mokutil --set-sbat-policy` 应用 SBAT 策略更新，防止绕过 Secure Boot 的利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0678","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346118","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0678.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0678.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0678.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/aac3a899cc6ce8d928dfc5818dafc093b7936010/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0678","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/917696d148c885368c24cb2bf38f1552da3d5c31/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0678.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0678.json","https://github.com/lgirdk/poky/blob/a7331c399252c8b365e51290c8eba3d2f6aa6fa1/meta/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2025-0678_CVE-2025-1125.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0678.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0462","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0462.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1125","title":"GNU GRUB2 HFS 文件系统整数溢出堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 HFS 文件系统模块在读取 HFS 文件系统数据时，使用来自文件系统元数据的用户可控参数来计算内部缓冲区大小，但未正确检查整数溢出。攻击者可构造恶意的 HFS 文件系统镜像，使缓冲区大小计算发生溢出，导致 grub_malloc() 分配的内存小于预期。随后 hfsplus_open_compressed_real() 函数会将数据写入超出缓冲区长度的内存区域，从而篡改 GRUB 内部关键数据，绕过安全启动保护机制并实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用 GRUB2 引导加载程序且支持 HFS 文件系统的系统，包括基于 Linux 和 macOS 的引导环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1125"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T15:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:54Z","remediation":"升级 grub2 到已修复版本：Debian/Ubuntu 用户升级至 grub2 ≥ 2.06-3~deb11u7（bullseye-security）、2.06-13+deb12u2（bookworm）或 2.14-3（sid/trixie）；RHEL/CentOS 用户升级至 grub2 ≥ 2.06-99.el9 或检查 RHSA 公告获取具体版本。若暂时无法升级，可通过 GRUB 命令行禁用 hfs/hfsplus 模块加载（执行 grub-probe 后从 grub.cfg 中移除 hfs 模块引用），或从 GRUB 配置中移除对 HFS+ 文件系统的依赖。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-1125","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346138","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1125.md","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-1125.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7040aa3cef70d03b2345cd387b32b51374b6a04e/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1125.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/a986d397d7e52f53dac4700bfd3e066025913d55/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/52b9b2174100baa8a02c74cb223058f3005f5887/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1125.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-1125","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e7ffe335b9e43de0462b999586e11c70c219af1c/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1125.json","https://github.com/lgirdk/poky/blob/a7331c399252c8b365e51290c8eba3d2f6aa6fa1/meta/recipes-bsp/grub/files/CVE-2025-0678_CVE-2025-1125.patch","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-1125.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-1125.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0462.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0410","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0410.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0689","title":"GNU GRUB2 UDF文件系统模块堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 UDF 文件系统模块存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。当从磁盘读取数据时，该模块使用用户可控的数据长度元数据来分配内部缓冲区，在遍历磁盘扇区过程中错误地假设每次读取大小始终小于分配的缓冲区大小，但这一假设无法保证。攻击者可通过挂载特制的恶意文件系统镜像触发该漏洞，导致堆缓冲区溢出，造成关键数据损坏，进而实现任意代码执行，从而绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 GRUB2 的系统，攻击者需要物理访问或诱导用户重启系统加载恶意镜像，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0689"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-03T15:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"立即将 GRUB2 升级至包含 2025 年 2 月安全补丁的版本（>2.12），或安装各发行版提供的对应安全更新（如 Red Hat 相关补丁）。同时更新 shim 引导加载器至包含最新 SBAT 吊销数据的版本，使用 `mokutil --sbatpolicy` 应用吊销策略以防止旧版 GRUB2 被加载。如无法立即更新，可在 UEFI 固件设置中启用 Secure Boot 并确保 SBAT 策略生效作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0689","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346122","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0689.md","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0689.nopatch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0689.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/196de324bef0b2bc7cea062a29732233dff945fc/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0689.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0689","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0689.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0689.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-0689.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0410.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0621","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0621.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1795","title":"Python CPython 电子邮件标头折叠Unicode编码不当漏洞","description":"CPython 电子邮件库在处理邮件地址列表折叠时，当分隔逗号位于需要 Unicode 编码的折行上时，该逗号本身也被错误地进行了 Unicode 编码，而非保持为普通逗号。此缺陷源于对 RFC 5322 邮件头折叠规范的实现不当（CWE-116），可导致某些邮件服务器错误解析邮件地址头信息，造成邮件路由或投递异常。攻击者可通过构造特制的邮件头利用此漏洞，攻击复杂度较高，需具备低权限且需用户交互。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1795"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-28T19:15:36Z","updated":"2026-07-31T14:16:44Z","remediation":"升级 CPython 至 3.11.10+、3.12.5+ 或 3.13.0+ 版本，这些版本已合入修复提交 09fab93（防止逗号分隔符被错误编码）和 858b9e8（修复回归问题并补充遗漏场景）。如无法立即升级，可在邮件处理流程中避免对长地址列表进行折叠操作，或使用外部邮件解析库（如 `email6`）替代标准库 `email` 模块的 `_header_va