c_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0621.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0619","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1744","title":"radareorg radare2 堆缓冲区溢出越界写入漏洞","description":"radare2 存在一个严重的越界写入漏洞（Out-of-bounds Write），具体表现为堆缓冲区溢出或越界读取。攻击者可以通过构造恶意文件并引导受害者使用 5.9.9 之前的 radare2 版本进行分析，触发该内存损坏漏洞。由于该漏洞允许在堆内存中执行非法写入，可能导致目标程序崩溃或实现远程代码执行（RCE）。该漏洞影响所有 5.9.9 之前的版本，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，具有极高的危害性。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1744"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-28T04:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:42Z","remediation":"建议将 radare2 升级至 5.9.9 或更高版本。对于使用 Linux 发行版包管理器的用户，请运行相应的更新命令（如 dnf update 或 apt-get upgrade）以安装由发行版维护的最新补丁版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/radareorg/radare2/pull/23969","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/22bf0a843f1870af65d30413f104d6fa91f5e1f4/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/22bf0a843f1870af65d30413f104d6fa91f5e1f4/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-1744.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-1744","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-17xx/CVE-2025-1744.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0941","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0941.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21714","title":"Linux内核 RDMA/mlx5 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux内核RDMA/mlx5子系统存在隐式ODP内存区域释放后使用漏洞。在销毁隐式ODP MR时，由于竞态条件，销毁工作可能被重复排队。第二个工作项在第一个工作已释放MR后仍会执行，导致引用计数下溢和use-after-free。攻击者需具备本地访问权限和低权限账户即可触发该漏洞，可能导致权限提升或系统崩溃。CVSS评分为7.8（高危），CWE编号为CWE-416。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21714"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:05Z","remediation":"立即升级内核至已修复版本：RHEL 9 用户升级至 kernel-5.14.0-611.5.1.el9_7 或更高版本；Debian/Ubuntu 用户升级至 linux-image 6.5.0 或 6.12.13 及以上版本；上游 kernel 用户升级至 6.5.0 或之后版本。升级后必须重启系统使补丁生效。若无法立即升级，可临时禁用 RDMA/IB 用户态驱动（卸载 mlx5_ib 模块：`modprobe -r mlx5_ib`）以阻止攻击路径，但会导致 InfiniBand/RDMA 网络功能不可用，仅作为紧急缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7cc8f681f6d4ae4478ae0f60485fc768f2b450da","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d3d930411ce390e532470194296658a960887773","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/edfb65dbb9ffd3102f3ff4dd21316158e56f1976","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b7225b049fb11840df1a866370e432ba580ab817/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21714","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/d1caf066f07f7ba824b5a9683e9bc007d3ab681f/tracker/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-217xx/CVE-2025-21714.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21714.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0941.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0940","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0940.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21712","title":"Linux 内核 md-bitmap 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 md/md-bitmap 驱动存在同步机制缺陷，bitmap_get_stats() 函数未与位图生命周期正确同步，可在位图已被销毁或尚未完全初始化时被调用，导致对已释放或不存在的位图结构体进行解引用，触发内核通用保护错误（Oops）及内核崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中使用软件 RAID（md 模块）的系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过在特定时序下读取 /proc 文件系统触发竞争条件，可导致本地拒绝服务（内核 panic），在特定场景下或可进一步利用实现本地权限提升。CVSS 评分为 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21712"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:14Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:20:26Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit ec6bb299c7c3 修复的稳定版本：Debian 12 用户应执行 apt update && apt install linux-image-6.1.90-1，Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / 24.04 LTS 用户应安装 USN-7703-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可通过 chmod 600 /proc/mdstat 限制非特权用户读取 md 位图统计信息，或使用 sysctl 禁用 md 序列接口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/032fa54f486eac5507976e7e31f079a767bc13a8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/237e19519c8ff6949f0ef57c4a0243f5b2b0fa18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e9316eee3885bfb311b4759513f2ccf37891c09","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/52848a095b55a302af92f52ca0de5b3112059bb8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d28d0ddb986f56920ac97ae704cc3340a699a30","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eb2f9d98cd3e94a79fbf8fb90637c5b12e805428","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00045.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21712.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/6328604d51f0e7cc4b3e68655032b1e8eac05ea7/2025/CVE-2025-21712.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21712.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21712.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21712.md","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21712.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21712-2025-11-03-1326","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21712.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b290a4630bf00bc86efda07bc07c03b933274d3f/2025/CVE-2025-21712.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21712"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0940.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0939","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0939.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21711","title":"Linux 内核 ROSE 网络子系统整数溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Linux 内核 net/rose 子系统的 rose_setsockopt() 函数存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当用户传入超大参数值并通过乘法运算进一步放大时，可能导致整数溢出，进而引发拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响支持 ROSE（业余无线电）网络协议的内核版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限和低级别权限，无需用户交互即可利用。成功利用可导致系统可用性严重受损，造成服务中断或内核崩溃。漏洞成因是函数未对 opt 参数范围进行充分校验，修复方案为增加参数边界检查并改用无符号整数类型。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21711"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:44:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上版本；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户可升级至 5.15.0-140.150，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可升级至 6.8.0-64.67。如暂无法升级，可执行 modprobe -r rose 或向 /etc/modprobe.d/disable-rose.conf 写入 install rose /bin/false 以禁用 ROSE 模块作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/352daa50946c3bbb662432e8daf54d6760796589","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4bdd449977e2364a53d0b2a5427e71beb1cd702d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9bdee49ad6bbd26ab5e13cc6731e54fb1b6c1dca","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b8583b54455cbec2fc038fa32b6700890b369815","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d08f4074f9c69f7e95502587eb1b258a965ba7f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d640627663bfe7d8963c7615316d7d4ef60f3b0b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e5338930a29d0ab2a5af402f5f664aeba0d1a676","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21711.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21711.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21711.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21711.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21711.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1ce9765ce7bccd5f940cdb53e9ce6846944cee75/2025/CVE-2025-21711.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21711-2025-11-03-1401","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21711-2025-11-03-1335","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2025/CVE-2025-21711.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21711.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0939.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0938","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0938.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21707","title":"Linux 内核 MPTCP 子选项状态位字段未初始化漏洞","description":"Linux 内核多路径 TCP（MPTCP）子选项状态处理机制存在缺陷，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 MPTCP 数据包触发该漏洞。由于接收子选项的状态位掩码和相关位字段未在解析前正确初始化，MPTCP 代码在处理入站选项时可能使用未初始化的内存值，导致内核崩溃或敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响启用了 MPTCP 的 Linux 内核版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分为 9.8，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21707"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:14Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:20:02Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至已修复的稳定版本：5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以后版本。Debian 12（bookworm）用户可安装 linux 6.1.180-1 及以上版本，Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户可安装 5.15.0-140.150 内核，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可安装 6.8.0-64.67 内核。若无法立即升级，可在防火墙或 sysctl 层面禁用 MPTCP 作为临时缓解措施：执行 echo 0 > /proc/sys/net/mp tcp/enabled 或添加 net.mptcp.enabled=0 到内核启动参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3a7fda57b0f91f7ea34476b165f91a92feb17c96","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3b5332d416d151a15742d1b16e7319368e3cc5c6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6169e942370b4b6f9442d35c51519bf6c346843b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7f6c72b8ef8130760710e337dc8fbe7263954884","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba0518f9e8688cd4fcb569e8df2a74874b4f3894","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c86b000782daba926c627d2fa00c3f60a75e7472","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2025/CVE-2025-21707.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2025/CVE-2025-21707.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21707.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21707.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21707.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0988da272fdff1c0478190f98ae908e713ffb42d/references/CveServices-CVE-2025-21707-2025-11-03-1401","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21707.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21707","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/d1caf066f07f7ba824b5a9683e9bc007d3ab681f/tracker/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-21707.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/23db06c846c311649f2b9286666819be07aef69e/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2025-21707-2025-11-03-1401"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0938.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0615","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1632","title":"libarchive libarchive 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"libarchive 3.7.7 及之前版本的 bsdunzip.c 文件中 list 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。攻击者可通过构造特制的 ZIP 归档文件，诱导受害者在本地使用 libarchive 解压处理时触发空指针解引用，导致程序崩溃造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 libarchive 的应用程序（如 tar、bsdtar 等归档工具及依赖该库的软件），攻击条件为本地访问且需低权限，无需用户交互。CVSS 4.0 评分 4.8（MEDIUM），主要影响可用性。目前厂商未发布官方补丁，建议升级至 3.7.8 或更高版本，或在解压不可信归档前进行输入验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1632"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-24T14:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:30Z","remediation":"升级到 libarchive 3.7.8 或更高版本，其中修复了 bsdunzip.c 中 list 函数的空指针异常问题。如无法立即升级，可在编译时使用 -DDISABLE_BSDUNZIP 选项禁用该功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Ekkosun/pocs/blob/main/bsdunzip-poc","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.296619","https://vuldb.com/?id.296619","https://vuldb.com/?submit.496460","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1632.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1632.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ccb82e19d454ec66425149e039b563fe786feea5/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1632.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1632.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-1632.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a0729be792e60156d89de75025b409016df9594f/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-1632.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a0729be792e60156d89de75025b409016df9594f/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-1632.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-1632.json","https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/blob/60ba549684a216a065d8ec58db901d4b11f263e2/docs/resources/changelogs/cloud/release-notes/25_06.mdx","https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/blob/60ba549684a216a065d8ec58db901d4b11f263e2/docs/zh/resources/changelogs/cloud/release-notes/25_06.mdx"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0615.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0615.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0411","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0411.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0690","title":"GNU GRUB2 read命令整数溢出导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GNU GRUB2 的 read 命令存在整数溢出漏洞。read 命令用于从键盘读取用户输入，其内部使用 32 位整数存储输入长度，当输入超长字符串时该整数可发生溢出，导致堆缓冲区越界写入。攻击者需具备物理访问权限和高权限账户，并诱导用户输入特制超长字符串，成功利用后可破坏 GRUB 内部关键数据，进而可能绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动机制。该漏洞影响所有使用 GRUB2 的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0690"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-24T08:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:50Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至 2.12 以上版本，或应用上游补丁（commit dad8f502974e）。RHEL 9 用户安装 grub2-1:2.06-104.el9_6 及以上版本（RHSA-2025:6990）。Debian/Ubuntu 用户更新至 grub2-common 2.12-1 以上。无法立即更新时，限制物理接触引导菜单的用户权限以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:6990","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-0690","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346123","https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/grub-devel/2025-02/msg00024.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0690.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2025/CVE-2025-0690.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/f04086554da9724fc9382f780b507b33e9a17dfc/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2025-0690.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/19ecd583c2b44d2d11d14afed4fb66dab00aefa4/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0690.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0690","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0690.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/913667a73bdbecec80569e2765753066c820c678/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-0690.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/g/grub2/0331-commands-read-Fix-an-integer-overflow-when-supplying.patch","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/kaleth4/CVE-2025-0690"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0411.toml"}]